<title>USA: Murdock names firm to advise on strategies.</title>
<headline>Murdock names firm to advise on strategies.</headline>
<dateline>CEDAR RAPIDS, Iowa 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Murdock Communications Corp said Wednesday that it named Blalock &amp; Co, investment bankers, to provide advice regarding &quot;growth strategies and financing alternatives.&quot;</p>
<p>Murdock also announced the appointment of Desmond Towey &amp; Associates as the company's investor relations consultant.</p>
